	<#bbbbbb>This move list assumes you are facing to the right.</>

	<#19cf2c>UNIQUE TRAIT: VOLT BAR</>
	Z's Remix Moves are fueled by his Volt Bar.
	Not only are his Remix Moves powerful movement options, but he can
	cancel Normal Moves and airborne Special Moves into them on hit.
	The Volt Bar automatically refills over time.

	<#19cf2c>UNIQUE MOVES</>
SECOND STRIKE	-		^B_-^B
SUDDEN FLASH	-		_B_-^B
ROLLING THUNDER	-		_DF^C











_D	_D		_D

	<#19cf2c>SPECIAL MOVES</>
BOLT PRIMER	-		<#aaffff>(GROUND OR AIR)</> ^Y
   <#bbbbbb>Using this move gives you a <#19cf2c>Z Charge<#bbbbbb>.</>
BOLT SHOT	-		<#aaffff>(GROUND OR AIR)</> ^Y
   <#bbbbbb>This move requires a <#19cf2c>Z Charge<#bbbbbb> to use.
   Air version can be canceled into _F^Y on hit.</>
STATIC WAVE	-		_F^Y
_!DETONATE	-		^Y
THUNDER CRASH	-		<#65b5ff>(AIR ONLY)</> _F^Y
CAPACITOR TURNOUT	-		<#aaffff>(GROUND OR AIR)</> _B^Y
   <#bbbbbb>A <#19cf2c>Z charge<#bbbbbb> can be used to cast this move a second time.
   Crumples on counter-hit.</>
BREWING SHOCKWAVE	-		_D^Y
   <#bbbbbb>A counter. Does not beat projectiles or grabs.
   Creates a bolt where the enemy lands after it hits.</>







_D	_D		_D

	<#19cf2c>REMIX MOVES</>
SONIC JUMP	-		^Z/_D^Z
   <#bbbbbb>Holding down makes Z jump lower.
   This move launches enemies during combos.</>
STATIC HOVER	-		<#65b5ff>(AIR ONLY)</> (HOLD) ^Z
   <#bbbbbb>This move requires <#19cf2c>Volt Bar<#bbbbbb> to use.
   You can input any direction during this move to fly.</>
IMPETUS SURGE	-		<#65b5ff>(AIR ONLY)</> (ANY DIRECTION)+^Z
   <#bbbbbb>This move requires <#19cf2c>Volt Bar<#bbbbbb> to use.</>













_D	_D		_D

	<#ffef0f>EX MOVES</>
_EX BOLT PRIMER	-		<#aaffff>(GROUND OR AIR)</><#55ffff>(1 BAR)</> ^Y+^Z
   <#bbbbbb>Using this move gives you a <#19cf2c>Z Charge<#bbbbbb> and
   refills the <#19cf2c>Volt Bar<#bbbbbb>.</>
_EX BOLT SHOT	-		<#aaffff>(GROUND OR AIR)<#55ffff>(1 BAR)</> ^Y+^Z
   <#bbbbbb>This move requires a <#19cf2c>Z Charge<#bbbbbb> to use.
   Air version can be canceled into _F^Y on hit.</>
_EX STATIC WAVE	-		<#55ffff>(1 BAR)</> _F^Y+^Z
_!DETONATE	-		<#aaffff>(GROUND OR AIR)</> _F^Y+^Z
_EX THUNDER CRASH	-		<#65b5ff>(AIR ONLY)<#55ffff>(1 BAR)</> _F^Y+^Z
_EX CAPACITOR TURNOUT	-		<#aaffff>(GROUND OR AIR)<#55ffff>(1 BAR)</> _B^Y+^Z
   <#bbbbbb>This move is faster when used during a combo.</>
_EX ACTIVE SHOCKWAVE	-		<#55ffff>(1 BAR)</> _D^Y+^Z
   <#bbbbbb>An invincible reversal attack.
   Creates a bolt where the enemy lands after it hits.</>







_D	_D		_D

	<#55ffff>SUPERS</>
<#19cf2c>BLOWN FUSE</>		<#aaffff>(GROUND OR AIR)<#55ffff>(2 BARS)</> _D_DF_F_-^A/^B/^C
   <#bbbbbb>The grounded version is invincible.</>
<#19cf2c>RISING CURRENT</>	-		<#55ffff>(2 BARS)</> _D_DB_B_-^A/^B/^C
   <#bbbbbb>An anti-air/anti-projectile super.</>
<#19cf2c>THE FINAL STRIKE</>		<#aaffff>(GROUND OR AIR)<#55ffff>(6 BARS)</> _D_DF_F_-^Y
   <#bbbbbb>A powerful, invincible attack.</>















_D	_D		_D

	UNIVERSAL MOVES
OVERHEAD	-		_F^B
   <#bbbbbb>Puts you in the air and hits overhead.</>
ANTI-AIR	-		_D^C
   <#bbbbbb>This move has invulnerability to projectiles and airborne enemies.</>
GRAB	-		ANY 2 NORMALS </>
   <#bbbbbb>Cannot be blocked. Starts combos on counter-hit.
   Enemies can break this by pressing ^A/^B/^C.</>
FORCE BLOCK (WHILE BLOCKING)	-		<#55ffff>(1 BAR)</> _B^X
   <#bbbbbb>Can push the enemy backwards while you block.</>
NO PARRY	-		<#aaffff>(GROUND OR AIR)</><#55ffff>(1 BAR)</> _F^X
   <#bbbbbb>A reversal option that makes you invincible if the enemy hits you.
   Can be used again FOR FREE while the invincibility is active.</>
RECORD SCRATCH (WHILE ATTACKING)		<#55ffff>(1 BAR/2 BARS ON BLOCK)</> ^X
   <#bbbbbb>Can be used to instantly cancel most attacks.
   Holding any direction during this will cause you to move that way.</>
BURST (WHILE GETTING HIT)	-		^X+^A/^B/^C
   <#bbbbbb>A large reversal that can be used while you're getting hit.</>
PANIC BURST (WHILE GETTING HIT)	-		<#55ffff>(5 BARS)</> ^X+^A/^B/^C
   <#bbbbbb>An extra burst that can be used in an emergency.</>
   <#ff0000>Using this PERMANENTLY lowers your max meter
   for the rest of the game.</>
